---
import { lastmodOf } from "../lib/lastmod";
import Prose from "../layouts/Prose.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---
<Prose title="Terms of Service | Gunther Heller" h1="Terms of service" path="/terms/" description="Terms for using Gunther Heller's calorie and nutrition pages: general information from USDA data, not medical advice.">
  <p>This page last changed on <time datetime={lastmodOf("/terms/")}>{new Date(lastmodOf("/terms/") + "T12:00:00Z").toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: "long", day: "numeric", year: "numeric", timeZone: "UTC" })}</time>.</p>
  <h2>Information, not advice</h2>
  <p>Calorie and nutrient figures here describe average foods as USDA measured them. Your food can differ by brand, recipe and portion. Nothing on this site is medical or dietary advice; for that, see a doctor or a registered dietitian.</p>
  <h2>Using our content</h2>
  <p>The underlying USDA data is public domain. Our page text, layouts and compilations are ours: link to a page rather than copying it.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
</Prose>
